[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0805","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0805.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54909","title":"Pion STUN 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"pion/stun 是 Go 语言实现的 STUN 协议库，用于会话穿透应用（Session Traversal Utilities for NAT）。在 3.1.3 版本之前，该库的 XORMappedAddress.GetFromAs 函数在处理畸形短 XOR-MAPPED-ADDRESS 属性时缺乏充分的输入验证，导致在处理 STUN 或 ICE Binding-response 解析路径中的畸形数据包时发生程序 panic（崩溃）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的恶意 STUN 消息触发该漏洞，造成远程拒绝服务攻击，使依赖该库的应用程序或服务停止响应。该漏洞影响使用受感染版本 pion/stun 库构建的各类 WebRTC、ICE 及 NAT 穿透应用，攻击条件为攻击者能够与目标服务建立网络连接并发送构造的数据包，无需用户交互或权限验证。建议升级到 v3.1.3 或更高版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54909","GHSA-34rh-wp3j-6cxc"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-31T23:17:25Z","updated":"2026-07-31T23:17:25Z","remediation":"将 Pion STUN Go 库升级至 v3.1.3 或更高版本，或直接应用补丁 https://github.com/pion/stun/pull/278 修复 XOR-MAPPED-ADDRESS 属性解析中的 panic 问题；如短期内无法升级，建议在 STUN/ICE 服务前部署 WAF 或网络 ACL，过滤异常的 STUN Binding Response 报文以降低拒绝服务风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/pion/stun/commit/fa9f074a33a8059c76c960b1fbee39f308002423","https://github.com/pion/stun/pull/278","https://github.com/pion/stun/releases/tag/v3.1.3","https://github.com/pion/stun/security/advisories/GHSA-34rh-wp3j-6cxc","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54909.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54909.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54909.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b5070d3c2d6dc2fda079c163276abcda1c82b124/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-549xx/CVE-2026-54909.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/go/github.com/pion/stun/CVE-2026-54909.yml","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/go/github.com/pion/stun/v2/CVE-2026-54909.yml","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/go/github.com/pion/stun/v3/CVE-2026-54909.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/e9f55b097256f05949a0f1dbecc8a1a5fe970fe7/content/posts/cve-2026-54909.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2026/CVE-2026-54909.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2026/CVE-2026-54909.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0805.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0803","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0803.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54787","title":"Sigstore sigstore-go 签名时间戳有效性校验缺失漏洞","description":"sigstore-go 是 Sigstore 用于签名与验签的 Go 库（版本早于 1.2.1）。该库在校验 bundle 签名时，未将 bundle 的签名时间戳与签名密钥的有效期窗口进行比对。对于自托管、无证书的长生命周期签名密钥，用户需通过 root.NewExpiringKey 将其包装为带有过期语义的 ExpiringKey 类型，向量参数的校验器却未按 API 约定检查 bundle 签名时间是否落在该有效期窗口内。攻击原理是：获得已过期密钥材料的攻击者可利用这些材料对 bundle 进行签名，由于校验器不检查签名时间戳与密钥有效期，此类签名仍会被当作有效的 bundle 接受。影响范围仅涉及使用长生命周期签名密钥的工作流，不涉及依赖证书颁发机构（CA）的标准部署方式。攻击条件为需持有已过期但被信任的签名密钥材料，可用性与机密性影响有限，该漏洞 CVSS 评分为 3.1（低危）。利用方式为使用过期密钥材料对 bundle 签名并提交验证，从而绕过配置的过期日期。该漏洞已在 1.2.1 版本中修复。","severity":"LOW","score":3.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54787","GHSA-wqqc-jjcq-vfxm"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-31T23:17:25Z","updated":"2026-08-01T00:17:17Z","remediation":"建议立即将 sigstore-go 升级到 v1.2.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复签名时间戳未与 ExpiringKey 有效期校验的问题（详见 https://github.com/sigstore/sigstore-go/releases/tag/v1.2.1 与提交 4594ab4c779d08be1f4419803a8249188f35ed5f）。如无法立即升级，需自行实施缓解措施：对使用自管理长期密钥且未使用证书的验证流程，在调用验证逻辑前显式检查 bundle 的签名时间（SignedTimestamp）是否落在密钥有效性窗口内，仅接受位于有效期内的签名；同时严格管控并使用强口令保护长期密钥材料，防止已到期的密钥被泄露或重用，并密切监控密钥生命周期以确保过期密钥无法再用于生成被接受的 bundle。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/sigstore/sigstore-go/commit/4594ab4c779d08be1f4419803a8249188f35ed5f","https://github.com/sigstore/sigstore-go/pull/642","https://github.com/sigstore/sigstore-go/releases/tag/v1.2.1","https://github.com/sigstore/sigstore-go/security/advisories/GHSA-wqqc-jjcq-vfxm","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54787.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54787.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54787.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54787.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54787.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b5070d3c2d6dc2fda079c163276abcda1c82b124/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-547xx/CVE-2026-54787.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/go/github.com/sigstore/sigstore-go/CVE-2026-54787.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/e9f55b097256f05949a0f1dbecc8a1a5fe970fe7/content/posts/cve-2026-54787.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2026/CVE-2026-54787.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2026/CVE-2026-54787.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0803.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0802","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0802.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54785","title":"eLyiN gemini-bridge 任意本地文件读取漏洞","description":"gemini-bridge 是一款轻量级 MCP 服务器，其 `consult_gemini_with_files` 工具在 inline 模式下未对 `files` 参数中的文件路径进行有效限制，`_resolve_path` 函数仅对显示名称进行空值处理而未实际校验路径是否超出工作目录，导致绝对路径、`..` 目录遍历及符号链接逃逸均可被利用。攻击者（如恶意 MCP 客户端或经提示注入的 LLM）可读取服务器进程权限范围内的任意文件（包括 SSH 密钥、云服务凭证、`.env` 环境变量及源代码），并通过 Gemini 往返回显将文件内容泄露给攻击者。该漏洞无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低，影响版本 1.0.0 至 1.3.1，已在 1.3.1 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54785","GHSA-c5px-58j2-7fqp"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-31T23:17:25Z","updated":"2026-07-31T23:17:25Z","remediation":"立即升级 gemini-bridge 至 v1.3.1 或以上版本，该版本已修复 `_resolve_path` 路径穿越与符号链接逃逸问题。如无法立即升级，避免在 `consult_gemini_with_files` 中使用 `mode=\"inline\"` 处理不可信的 `files` 参数，或以低权限用户运行 MCP 服务器进程限制可读取文件范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/eLyiN/gemini-bridge/commit/8f3b85afd02b692c4bc974b5176e12fb277ea801","https://github.com/eLyiN/gemini-bridge/pull/9","https://github.com/eLyiN/gemini-bridge/releases/tag/v1.3.1","https://github.com/eLyiN/gemini-bridge/security/advisories/GHSA-c5px-58j2-7fqp","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54785.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54785.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54785.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/pypi/gemini-bridge/CVE-2026-54785.yml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b5070d3c2d6dc2fda079c163276abcda1c82b124/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-547xx/CVE-2026-54785.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/e9f55b097256f05949a0f1dbecc8a1a5fe970fe7/content/posts/cve-2026-54785.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2026/CVE-2026-54785.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2026-54785.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a0a14ea0f3a80067c6bf2249ad236215b48e4418/2026/CVE-2026-54785.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/7eddfa17a1f79adc987d1c721a78e31a8cb35b16/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-54785.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0802.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0802.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0801","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0801.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54768","title":"WPGraphQL 废弃 user 字段导致用户枚举与信息泄露漏洞","description":"WPGraphQL 插件中 `sendPasswordResetEmail` 变更的返回类型存在信息泄露漏洞。该插件在设计上通过始终返回 `success: true` 来防止用户枚举，但已废弃的 `user` 字段仍注册在 `SendPasswordResetEmailPayload` 输出类型上。未经身份认证的攻击者可向目标 WordPress 站点发送包含目标用户名或邮箱的 GraphQL 查询，若该用户为作者类用户则返回完整的 User 对象（含 databaseId、name、slug 等公开字段），否则返回 null，从而绕过反枚举机制实现用户身份枚举与公开资料窃取。该漏洞影响 WPGraphQL 2.0.0 至 2.15.1 版本，CVSS 评分 6.9，危害等级中危。建议升级至 2.15.1 或移除废弃的 user 字段。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54768","GHSA-jhh7-832h-f8hv"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-31T23:17:24Z","updated":"2026-07-31T23:17:24Z","remediation":"立即将 WPGraphQL 插件升级至 2.15.1 或更高版本，该版本已移除存在信息泄露的已废弃 user 字段。如无法立即升级，可临时在 WPGraphQL 注册的 GraphQL 端点前添加 WAF 规则，拦截对 sendPasswordResetEmail mutation 中 user 字段的查询，或通过 WordPress 插件代码在 Deprecated.php 中将 user 字段的 resolve 函数改为始终返回 null。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/wp-graphql/wp-graphql/releases/tag/wp-graphql/v2.15.1","https://github.com/wp-graphql/wp-graphql/security/advisories/GHSA-jhh7-832h-f8hv","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54768.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54768.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54768.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54768.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/packagist/wp-graphql/wp-graphql/CVE-2026-54768.yml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-547xx/CVE-2026-54768.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/e9f55b097256f05949a0f1dbecc8a1a5fe970fe7/content/posts/cve-2026-54768.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a0a14ea0f3a80067c6bf2249ad236215b48e4418/2026/CVE-2026-54768.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2026/CVE-2026-54768.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2026-54768.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0801.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0801.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0773","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0773.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53573","title":"GeoNetwork core-geonetwork 开放重定向绕过漏洞","description":"GeoNetwork 是一款用于管理空间参考资源的目录应用系统，其 OAuth2/OIDC 和 Keycloak 登录过滤器在验证用户登录后的重定向目标 URL 时存在安全验证绕过漏洞（CWE-601）。由于对重定向目标的校验逻辑不完善，未能正确拒绝所有可导致浏览器离开 GeoNetwork 源站点的 URL 格式，攻击者可构造特制的登录链接，诱使已登录用户在完成认证流程后被重定向至攻击者控制的外部站点，从而用于钓鱼攻击（如展示虚假登录表单）或链式攻击。该漏洞影响 GeoNetwork 3.12.0 至 4.2.16 及 4.4.11 版本，攻击者需具备低权限且需用户交互触发，CVSS 评分 4.8，危害等级中危。官方已在 4.2.16 和 4.4.11 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53573","GHSA-pjp7-q6wp-97qx"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-31T23:17:24Z","updated":"2026-07-31T23:17:24Z","remediation":"升级 GeoNetwork 至 4.2.16 或 4.4.11 及以上版本，这两个版本已修复 OAuth2/OIDC 和 Keycloak 登录后的开放重定向绕过漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层（如 Nginx）添加规则，拦截包含外部域名的 redirect 参数请求作为临时缓解措施。GeoNetwork 3.x 和 4.0.x 已停止维护，必须迁移至受支持版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/geonetwork/core-geonetwork/commit/0d74f673dfc926bde935819ed34636d789b2fecd","https://github.com/geonetwork/core-geonetwork/commit/cde9b6481a29e2473b7b74479b4e3fd6843bac4e","https://github.com/geonetwork/core-geonetwork/pull/9307","https://github.com/geonetwork/core-geonetwork/pull/9309","https://github.com/geonetwork/core-geonetwork/releases/tag/4.2.16","https://github.com/geonetwork/core-geonetwork/releases/tag/4.4.11","https://github.com/geonetwork/core-geonetwork/security/advisories/GHSA-pjp7-q6wp-97qx","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53573.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-53573.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-53573.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/d736f3597b7d4aff3836025a02aa5e53fcadb427/content/posts/cve-2026-53573.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-535xx/CVE-2026-53573.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/maven/org.geonetwork-opensource/geonetwork/CVE-2026-53573.yml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2026-53573.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0913c49bc4f4fd607e8625f162967246063e1d20/2026/CVE-2026-53573.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2026/CVE-2026-53573.json","https://github.com/VulnCorps/refgha/blob/25402c250d5a6853f14f5eaf6651e0f0973929e0/docs/data/cves/CVE-2026-53573.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0773.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0939","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0939.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-65841","title":"Jodit Jodit Editor SVG脚本绕过clean-html过滤的跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Jodit 编辑器（WYSIWYG 富文本编辑器）的 clean-html 净化功能存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。由于 SVG 或 MathML 命名空间中的元素节点名保持原始大小写（如 `script` 而非 `SCRIPT`），而 denyTags 过滤列表使用大写哈希进行匹配，导致嵌套在 SVG 中的 `<script>` 元素绕过过滤，保留在编辑器值中并在内容加载时执行。攻击者可利用此漏洞实现存储型或 DOM 型 XSS 攻击，在受害者（如管理员）的认证浏览器上下文中执行任意脚本。该漏洞影响 Jodit 4.13.6 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 5.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-65841","GHSA-45qg-252v-3f7p"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-31T20:16:53Z","updated":"2026-07-31T20:16:53Z","remediation":"立即将 Jodit 升级至 4.13.6 或更高版本，该版本修复了 SVG/MathML 命名空间中 script 标签大小写绕过过滤的问题。如无法立即升级，在服务端对用户提交的 HTML 内容进行独立 XSS 过滤（如 DOMPurify），移除所有 `<svg>` 和 `<math>` 内的 `<script>` 元素作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/xdan/jodit/commit/49a31f451f6b686f5610022a1d4406ee85138dc5","https://github.com/xdan/jodit/releases/tag/4.13.6","https://github.com/xdan/jodit/security/advisories/GHSA-45qg-252v-3f7p","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86965a1ef7a64a35a4bffc5193446981deb1b2f5/cves/2026/65xxx/CVE-2026-65841.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3d37661d066a8369751ae98676c11a2d9ec4d21/2026/65xxx/CVE-2026-65841.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-65841.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/152c4988e6630edbe300b2d9554f35d9c7963812/data/2026/CVE-2026-65841.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-65841.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-65841.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/npm/jodit/CVE-2026-65841.yml","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/7c77ebcc357386c71db522f18fa574b7642f74e0/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-65841.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-658xx/CVE-2026-65841.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3325b9a058340dae0cf4a308bd7383225ee5322b/content/posts/cve-2026-65841.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0939.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0912","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0912.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-62324","title":"Jodit Jodit 编辑器 javascript: 协议 href 过滤绕过跨站脚本漏洞","description":"tags. I can provide brief analysis but final answer in <value> tags. Let me keep it concise - just output the value tags.<value>Jodit 富文本编辑器（内置文件浏览器与图片编辑器）在 sanitizeHTMLElement 方法中校验 href 属性的 javascript: 协议时存在不完整的规范化逻辑，仅使用区分大小写的 href.trim().indexOf('javascript') === 0 进行字面匹配，未像其他 URL 属性那样先经 isDangerousUrl 去除控制字节（\\u0000-\\u0020）并转小写后再检测协议。攻击者可通过三类混淆形式绕过过滤：一是大小写变体（如 JAVASCRIPT:、Javascript:），二是前置非空白 C0 控制字节（如 \\x01），三是在协议内嵌入制表符或换行符（如 java\\tscript:、java\\nscript:）；浏览器在解析 URL 时会剥离控制字节与制表换行符且协议大小写不敏感，故点击后仍会按 javascript: 协议执行。恶意链接可经 editor.value 赋值并持久化到编辑器存储值中，属于存储型跨站脚本（CWE-79）。攻击前提是攻击者拥有编辑器实例的写入权限（如内容作者或多用户应用中的评论者），当受害者在只读编辑器、服务端渲染页面或 innerHTML 消费端点击该链接时，将在目标页面源域中执行攻击者控制的脚本。该漏洞影响 Jodit 4.12.31 之前的版本，CVSS 评分 5.4（中危），已在 4.12.31 版本中通过将 href 改由 isDangerousUrl 处理而修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-62324","GHSA-j839-gqq4-gf9j"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-31T20:16:53Z","updated":"2026-08-03T18:16:40Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Jodit 升级至 4.12.31 及以上版本，该版本已通过将 href 属性接入 isDangerousUrl() 归一化检查修复此 XSS 绕过（对应提交 5fba6ef2381d151d7cb8e3c5ad0b9996af0f97b0）。若暂时无法升级，应在渲染编辑器存储值前强制进行服务端或前端二次清洗，对所有 href 值执行去控制字节、转小写并校验 javascript:/vbscript: 等危险协议，禁止直接通过 innerHTML 渲染用户可控链接，同时可开启 CSP 限制内联脚本执行作为纵深防御。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/xdan/jodit/commit/5fba6ef2381d151d7cb8e3c5ad0b9996af0f97b0","https://github.com/xdan/jodit/releases/tag/4.12.31","https://github.com/xdan/jodit/security/advisories/GHSA-j839-gqq4-gf9j","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2026/62xxx/CVE-2026-62324.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3d37661d066a8369751ae98676c11a2d9ec4d21/2026/62xxx/CVE-2026-62324.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-62324.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-62324.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/152c4988e6630edbe300b2d9554f35d9c7963812/data/2026/CVE-2026-62324.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-62324.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-623xx/CVE-2026-62324.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/npm/jodit/CVE-2026-62324.yml","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/7c77ebcc357386c71db522f18fa574b7642f74e0/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-62324.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/97de0a0c0be6241ec441ae8eb7c7943a5ff88d4f/content/posts/cve-2026-62324.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0912.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0912.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0774","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0774.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53599","title":"REDAXO Mediapool 文件扩展名绕过漏洞导致远程代码执行","description":"REDAXO 媒体池组件中的文件扩展名检查函数 `rex_mediapool::isAllowedExtension` 存在绕过漏洞。该函数仅检查被禁扩展名是否出现在文件名末尾，而未检测多段扩展名链中非末段的被禁扩展名（如 `shell.php.any.jpg`）。具有媒体上传权限的认证后台用户可上传 JPEG/PHP 混合文件，在配置了多扩展名 PHP 处理器的 Apache 服务器上，通过请求该文件即可触发任意 PHP 代码执行，获取 Web 服务器权限。该漏洞影响 REDAXO 5.18.2 至 5.21.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者需具备后台用户权限且服务器使用 mod_mime 风格的多扩展名处理器。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53599","GHSA-98pp-vccm-qm25"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-31T20:16:51Z","updated":"2026-07-31T22:17:03Z","remediation":"立即升级 REDAXO 至 5.21.1 或更高版本（官方已在该版本中修复 isAllowedExtension 的多段扩展名绕过问题）。如无法立即升级，可修改 Apache 配置，将 PHP 处理器的 FilesMatch 正则添加结尾锚点（如 `<FilesMatch \".+\\.ph(?:ar|p|tml)$\">`），避免 mod_mime 多扩展名处理器执行非末端 .php 段；同时限制 mediapool 上传权限仅授予可信用户。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/redaxo/core/commit/462e36896bb65d292ba22d711044c23c9cfb0340","https://github.com/redaxo/core/pull/6538","https://github.com/redaxo/core/releases/tag/5.21.1","https://github.com/redaxo/core/security/advisories/GHSA-98pp-vccm-qm25","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53599.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53599.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-53599.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-53599.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-53599.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-535xx/CVE-2026-53599.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/packagist/redaxo/source/CVE-2026-53599.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/d736f3597b7d4aff3836025a02aa5e53fcadb427/content/posts/cve-2026-53599.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2026/CVE-2026-53599.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0913c49bc4f4fd607e8625f162967246063e1d20/2026/CVE-2026-53599.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0774.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0772","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0772.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53551","title":"free5GC AUSF 空字节注入拒绝服务漏洞","description":"free5GC 是一款开源的 5G 核心网实现，其 AUSF（认证服务器功能）组件在处理 UE 认证请求时未对 `supiOrSuci` 字段进行输入验证。攻击者可通过向 AUSF 的 `/nausf-auth/v1/ue-authentications` 端点发送包含空字节（`\\x00`）的恶意 JSON 请求，由于 Go 的 `encoding/json` 允许字符串中包含空字节，该请求被正常解析后，AUSF 将未转义的 `supiOrSuci` 值直接拼接到 UDM 请求 URL 中，导致 Go 的 `net/url.Parse()` 因 URL 中包含非法控制字符而解析失败，最终返回 HTTP 500 内部错误并泄露内部堆栈信息。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可批量发送此类请求，导致 AUSF 对所有合法用户的认证请求均返回 500 错误，造成服务拒绝。该漏洞影响 free5GC v4.2.2 及之前版本，已在 v1.4.5 中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53551","GHSA-qj55-47fp-p62j"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-31T20:16:51Z","updated":"2026-07-31T20:16:51Z","remediation":"立即升级 free5GC AUSF 至 v1.4.5 或更高版本（对应 free5GC 主项目 v4.2.3+），该版本已合入 supiOrSuci 输入校验和 URL 转义修复。如无法立即升级，可在 AUSF 前端部署反向代理（如 Nginx/Envoy），对 /nausf-auth/v1/ue-authentications 端点请求体中的 supiOrSuci 字段执行控制字符过滤（拒绝含 \\x00-\\x1f 字符的请求），或修改 AUSF 源码在构造 UDM URL 前调用 url.PathEscape() 对 supiOrSuci 进行转义。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/free5gc/ausf/commit/bfc4a10094dbacbd862baa4686829f3fcc06ce1e","https://github.com/free5gc/ausf/pull/61","https://github.com/free5gc/ausf/releases/tag/v1.4.5","https://github.com/free5gc/free5gc/issues/1048","https://github.com/free5gc/free5gc/releases/tag/v4.2.2","https://github.com/free5gc/free5gc/security/advisories/GHSA-qj55-47fp-p62j","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53551.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-53551.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/go/github.com/free5gc/ausf/CVE-2026-53551.yml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-53551.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/go/github.com/free5gc/free5gc/CVE-2026-53551.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/d736f3597b7d4aff3836025a02aa5e53fcadb427/content/posts/cve-2026-53551.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-535xx/CVE-2026-53551.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2026-53551.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2026/CVE-2026-53551.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0913c49bc4f4fd607e8625f162967246063e1d20/2026/CVE-2026-53551.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0772.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0772.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0772.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0771","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0771.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53510","title":"Savon Ruby SOAP 客户端远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Savon 是一个 Ruby 语言的 SOAP 客户端库，其 Savon::Model 模块在调用 .all_operations 方法时，会将 WSDL 中的操作名称直接拼接为 Ruby 源代码字符串并传递给 module_eval 执行。远程攻击者若能控制 WSDL 文档中的操作名称，即可注入恶意 Ruby 代码，在应用程序进程中实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Savon 0.9.8 至 2.17.2 版本，CVSS 评分 8.1，危害等级高。攻击者无需身份认证，但需要诱使目标应用解析包含恶意操作名称的 WSDL 文档。官方已在 Savon 2.17.2 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53510","GHSA-mx5j-mp4f-g8jg"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-31T20:16:51Z","updated":"2026-07-31T20:16:51Z","remediation":"立即将 savon gem 升级至 2.17.2 或更高版本：在 Gemfile 中执行 `gem 'savon', '>= 2.17.2'` 后运行 `bundle update savon`。如无法立即升级，避免对不可信 WSDL 文档使用 `.all_operations` 方法，改用 `.operations` 并仅传入受信任的操作名称列表。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/savonrb/savon/commit/8f22eb543e7436f6247172c9be47e22792d375e9","https://github.com/savonrb/savon/releases/tag/v2.17.2","https://github.com/savonrb/savon/security/advisories/GHSA-mx5j-mp4f-g8jg","https://github.com/rubysec/ruby-advisory-db/blob/e814c846b489961c36bd71e6c207d6f0b896cb6d/gems/savon/CVE-2026-53510.yml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53510.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53510.json","https://github.com/rubysec/rubysec.github.io/blob/0a5bc60878096d39ce1382513d3aa01b5d5c73a3/advisories/_posts/2026-06-10-CVE-2026-53510.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-53510.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-53510.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-53510.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/874e41a1c528e723f9fa8f58ba0c6da7734010ef/reports/2026-07-31/TIER_2_CVE-2026-53510.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-535xx/CVE-2026-53510.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/gem/savon/CVE-2026-53510.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0771.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0771.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0770","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0770.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53505","title":"Thumbor 图片缩略图服务 proportion 过滤器远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":")` filter doesn't enforce an upper bound on `<value>` and runs in the post-transform phase\n3. An attacker can trigger extremely large resizes (CPU/memory exhaustion) and cause denial of service\n4. Fixed in version 7.8.0\n5. CVSS 7.5 (HIGH), CWE-400\n6. No authentication required, network attack vector\n\nI need to write a Chinese description ≥50 characters covering:\n- Vulnerability principle (unbounded proportion filter → resource exhaustion)\n- Impact scope (Thumbor < 7.8.0)\n- Attack conditions (remote, no auth needed, via crafted URL)\n\nThe current description field has garbled content. Let me write a clean one.<value>Thumbor 是一款由 globo.com 开发的开源图片缩略图服务，其 filters:proportion(<value>) 滤镜在处理比例参数时未对 <value> 设置上限，且该滤镜在 POST_TRANSFORM 阶段执行，可绕过请求级别的大小限制。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造特制的图片请求 URL，触发引擎执行超大尺寸的图片缩放操作，导致目标服务器 CPU 和内存资源耗尽，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Thumbor 7.8.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53505","GHSA-phj3-59pf-cp83"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-31T19:17:10Z","updated":"2026-07-31T19:17:10Z","remediation":"`\n- CVSS 7.5, HIGH severity\n- CWE-400 Uncontrolled Resource Consumption\n\nI need to write a Chinese remediation with ≥20 characters, specific actionable steps.<value>立即升级 Thumbor 至 7.8.0 或更高版本，该版本已对 proportion 滤镜参数值实施上限校验（0.0 < value ≤ 1.0）。如无法立即升级，可在配置中禁用 proportion 滤镜（从 BUILTIN_FILTERS 中移除），或设置 ALLOW_UNSAFE_URL=False 并严格管控签名 URL 的签发权限，防止未授权用户构造恶意放大请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/thumbor/thumbor/commit/2c716119de986cfc68c7071af52a98187e006023","https://github.com/thumbor/thumbor/releases/tag/7.8.0","https://github.com/thumbor/thumbor/security/advisories/GHSA-phj3-59pf-cp83","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53505.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-53505.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-53505.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/pypi/thumbor/CVE-2026-53505.yml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-535xx/CVE-2026-53505.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/874e41a1c528e723f9fa8f58ba0c6da7734010ef/reports/2026-07-31/TIER_2_CVE-2026-53505.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/d736f3597b7d4aff3836025a02aa5e53fcadb427/content/posts/cve-2026-53505.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2026/CVE-2026-53505.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2026/CVE-2026-53505.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0913c49bc4f4fd607e8625f162967246063e1d20/2026/CVE-2026-53505.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0770.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0770.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0770.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0769","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0769.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53504","title":"Thumbor 卷积过滤器正则表达式拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Thumbor 是一款开源的图片缩略图服务，其 convolution 滤镜的正则表达式存在灾难性回溯（ReDoS）漏洞。该正则表达式在处理包含大量重复数值的输入时会产生指数级回溯，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 URL 请求（如包含多个重复分号分隔数值的 convolution 滤镜参数）触发该漏洞，导致服务器在处理该请求时 CPU 资源耗尽，无法继续处理其他图片请求，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Thumbor 7.8.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。官方已在 7.8.0 版本中通过修复正则表达式修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53504","GHSA-5vjc-7cxw-4w6j"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-31T19:17:09Z","updated":"2026-08-01T00:17:16Z","remediation":"立即升级 Thumbor 至 7.8.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 convolution 过滤器正则表达式的指数回溯问题。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层（如 Nginx）添加规则拦截包含大量重复数字的 convolution 参数请求，或禁用 convolution 过滤器功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/thumbor/thumbor/commit/3f38fe1610d20168e91f76d432212de30727eb2e","https://github.com/thumbor/thumbor/releases/tag/7.8.0","https://github.com/thumbor/thumbor/security/advisories/GHSA-5vjc-7cxw-4w6j","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53504.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53504.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-53504.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-53504.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-53504.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-535xx/CVE-2026-53504.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/pypi/thumbor/CVE-2026-53504.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/d736f3597b7d4aff3836025a02aa5e53fcadb427/content/posts/cve-2026-53504.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2026/CVE-2026-53504.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2026/CVE-2026-53504.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0769.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0769.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0768","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0768.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53503","title":"Globo Thumbor 卷积滤镜除零错误导致远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Thumbor 是一款开源图片缩略图服务，其 `convolution` 滤镜在处理用户传入的 `columns` 参数时，未校验该值是否大于 0 即直接将其作为除数传入 C 扩展层进行取模和除法运算。当攻击者构造 `columns=0` 的恶意请求时，C 扩展层触发除零异常（SIGFPE），导致 Thumbor 进程崩溃，造成远程拒绝服务。若服务启用了 `/unsafe/` URL 模式，未经认证的攻击者可远程触发该漏洞；若未启用，则需要攻击者持有有效签名 URL。该漏洞影响 Thumbor 7.8.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53503","GHSA-cqjp-jf4r-h5q9"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-31T19:17:09Z","updated":"2026-07-31T22:17:02Z","remediation":"立即升级 Thumbor 至 7.8.0 或更高版本（https://github.com/thumbor/thumbor/releases/tag/7.8.0），该版本已在 C 扩展层对 columns 参数增加零值校验。如无法立即升级，可在 Thumbor 配置中移除 `convolution` 过滤器或禁用 `/unsafe/` URL 模式（设置 `ALLOW_UNSAFE_URL=False`），并严格限制签名 URL 的发放范围仅限可信方。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/thumbor/thumbor/commit/447e192e3fb92e64c12e5354a56a4a7133f69d73","https://github.com/thumbor/thumbor/releases/tag/7.8.0","https://github.com/thumbor/thumbor/security/advisories/GHSA-cqjp-jf4r-h5q9","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53503.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53503.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-53503.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-53503.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-53503.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-535xx/CVE-2026-53503.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/pypi/thumbor/CVE-2026-53503.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/d736f3597b7d4aff3836025a02aa5e53fcadb427/content/posts/cve-2026-53503.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2026/CVE-2026-53503.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2026/CVE-2026-53503.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0768.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0768.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0768.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0767","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0767.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53502","title":"Thumbor file_loader 路径遍历漏洞","description":"Thumbor 是一款开源图片缩略图服务，其 file_loader 组件存在路径遍历漏洞。漏洞原理是 file_loader 在完成 `abspath()` 和 `startswith()` 根目录边界安全检查之后，才对文件路径执行 `unquote()` 解码操作。攻击者可通过 watermark 或 frame 滤镜传入经过双重 URL 编码的路径遍历序列（如 `%252e%252e` 表示 `..`），该序列在安全检查时被视为普通目录名而绕过验证，随后被 `unquote()` 解码为真实的 `..` 遍历序列，导致读取 FILE_LOADER_ROOT_PATH 之外的任意文件。攻击条件要求启用 `ALLOW_UNSAFE_URL = True`（默认开启）并使用 file_loader。成功利用可读取服务器上的配置文件、密钥、私有证书等敏感信息，CVSS 评分 8.7，危害等级高。该漏洞在 Thumbor 7.8.0 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53502","GHSA-cj54-hpcc-gj6h"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-31T19:17:09Z","updated":"2026-07-31T20:16:51Z","remediation":"立即升级 Thumbor 至 7.8.0 或更高版本（`pip install --upgrade thumbor`）。如无法升级，在配置中将 `ALLOW_UNSAFE_URL` 设为 `false`，或移除 `thumbor.loaders.file_loader` 改用其他 loader，或在反向代理层过滤包含 `%2e` 的请求路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/thumbor/thumbor/commit/3b986d13677b30fe6651c8c72ebb25957ac0a40d","https://github.com/thumbor/thumbor/releases/tag/7.8.0","https://github.com/thumbor/thumbor/security/advisories/GHSA-cj54-hpcc-gj6h","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53502.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53502.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-53502.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-53502.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-53502.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-535xx/CVE-2026-53502.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/pypi/thumbor/CVE-2026-53502.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/874e41a1c528e723f9fa8f58ba0c6da7734010ef/reports/2026-07-31/TIER_2_CVE-2026-53502.md","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/144e072a72718cf976367989b4ef7fcf3f72bd13/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-53502/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/d736f3597b7d4aff3836025a02aa5e53fcadb427/content/posts/cve-2026-53502.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0767.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0766","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0766.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53501","title":"Globo Thumbor HMAC验证绕过漏洞","description":"Thumbor 是一款开源的图片缩略图服务，其 HMAC-SHA1 签名验证机制存在绕过漏洞。由于在移除 URL 中的签名时使用了 Python 的 `.replace()` 方法，该方法会删除字符串中所有匹配的子串而非仅第一个，攻击者可在 URL 路径中插入多个签名副本。当服务端执行签名移除操作后，实际用于验证的 URL 与原始请求 URL 产生差异，从而绕过 HMAC 验证。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用此漏洞加载任意域名的图片资源，将 Thumbor 服务用作开放代理或图片抓取器，绕过域名白名单限制。该漏洞影响 Thumbor 7.8.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 8.2，危害等级高。官方已在 7.8.0 版本中通过限制仅移除第一个签名出现位置的方式修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53501","GHSA-mw3h-qjxj-6xg9"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-31T19:17:09Z","updated":"2026-07-31T20:16:51Z","remediation":"立即升级 Thumbor 至 7.8.0 或更高版本（commit e3ae3e25005），该版本已将签名移除逻辑改为仅替换首次出现。如无法升级，可临时在反向代理层（如 Nginx）配置规则拦截含重复 hash 片段的请求路径，或限制 Thumbor 实例仅允许白名单域名加载图片。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/thumbor/thumbor/commit/e3ae3e2500537b4d735df4144129a649374bb70b","https://github.com/thumbor/thumbor/releases/tag/7.8.0","https://github.com/thumbor/thumbor/security/advisories/GHSA-mw3h-qjxj-6xg9","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53501.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53501.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-53501.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-53501.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-53501.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-535xx/CVE-2026-53501.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/pypi/thumbor/CVE-2026-53501.yml","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/61da2f38bd4a3618729c795f1eb30d756288e7b3/2026/CVE-2026-53501/README.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/61da2f38bd4a3618729c795f1eb30d756288e7b3/2026/CVE-2026-53501/README_KO.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/874e41a1c528e723f9fa8f58ba0c6da7734010ef/reports/2026-07-31/TIER_2_CVE-2026-53501.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0766.toml"}]